rrent request set. Those two settings are no longer cached on the settings object, so the prefix is recomputed on each access.\n\nThe `{% static %}` tag, `STATIC_URL`-based staticfiles storage and the default media storage all read the settings through this path, so they pick up the prefix without further edits.\n\n**Tests:**\n- `settings_tests` passes.\n- In `staticfiles_tests` and `file_storage`, two tests (the `StaticLiveServerView` class and `FileLikeObjectTestCase`) error in `setUpClass` when binding a server socket. They also error without my change.\n- Four `file_storage` `test_setting_changed` tests fail because `test_setting_changed` expects an overridden `MEDIA_URL` of `overridden_media_url/` and now gets `/overridden_media_url/`. A relative value now gets the script prefix, which defaults to `/`. I didn't edit the test, as the rules forbid it.\n\nOne limit: storage objects created while a request is running pick up that request's prefix when they are built. `StaticFilesStorage` and the cached `base_url` on `FileSystemStorage` then keep that prefix instead of recomputing it per request.","ttft_ms":1684,"type":"result","duration_ms":36243,"uuid":"e7c9e0e9-db2a-4c17-b60e-c1529a2425ba","ttft_stream_ms":809,"time_to_request_ms":199,"first_content_frame_ms":809,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-sonnet-5-5":{"inputTokens":16,"outputTokens":2994,"cacheReadInputTokens":165118,"cacheCreationInputTokens":19180,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.12320380000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":741,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":19180,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}}}
